ProtocolFeeCollector::setTreasury
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new treasury is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
    ├── when new treasury equals the current treasury
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorNoStateChange
    └── when new treasury is valid and different
        ├── it should update treasury
        └── it should emit TreasuryUpdated
